    cards'' effects until the end of your next turn. You can only use each of the
    following effects of "Timaeus the United Magical Dragon" once per turn. If this
    card battles, during damage calculation: You can make this card gain 100 ATK
    for each Spell in the GYs and banishment. During your opponent''s turn (Quick
    Effect): You can target 1 Spell/Trap on the field; destroy it.'
